# Lowstreet (CIPlay lowstreet): the tram stop, the expedition plan, the cinema's projection box (wind turbine), the
# shops' air, the anglers, the electronics shop (advanced battery), the department store, the cage release refusing
# until the office's key, Ines's report, the lamp shop (advanced headlight), the big stingray, the diner.
# offset 0 0 is a placeholder: phase 2 sets it from the recipe's save log (PLAY_FORMAT: Coordinates).
island Lowstreet
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Drowned District
zone tram_stop
expect step 1
read Expedition plan
expect step 2
open Projection box
wait 3
expect step 3
zone shop_1
air shop_1
air shop_4
expect step 4
kill Angler fish
expect animals Angler fish 0
expect step 5
open Electronics shop
wait 3
expect step 6
zone store_front
expect step 7
use cagerelease
expect story cagesopen 0
open Floor manager's office
wait 3
expect story storekey 1
use cagerelease
expect story cagesopen 1
expect step 8
read Ines's report
expect step 9
open Lamp shop
wait 3
expect step 10
kill Stingray
expect step 11
zone embankment
expect step 12
read Depot timetable
expect step 13
zone tram_wagons
expect step 14
open Stripped caravan's crate
wait 3
expect step 15
# DEEP 10-24: the notice, the climb, the dive, the tram signal box
expect hidden ls_rewchest
use ls_machine
expect hidden ls_rewchest
read Tram signal notice
expect step 16
zone ls_trail
expect step 17
# (the ledge cache wants a keycard)
zone ls_summit
expect step 18
expect stand -32.8 -18.93 h=34
open Tram pylon deck box
wait 3
expect story ls_top 1
expect step 19
zone ls_deep
expect step 20
expect stand -69 26 h=-16
open Sunk tram depot strongbox
wait 3
expect story ls_deep 1
expect step 21
expect shown ls_bar
use ls_bolt
expect hidden ls_bar
expect story ls_bolt 1
expect step 22
use ls_machine
expect shown ls_rewchest
expect story ls_fixed 1
open Tram signal box reward
wait 3
read Tram timetable
expect step 23
open Diner
wait 3
expect done
